@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# Hand-over, 26 November 2026: events.b@ to cl-6.events@PrompTugal.dinis
+
+The role moved to account F on 26 Nov 2026. The new session is cl-6.events@PrompTugal.dinis (its home: PrompTugal/PrompTugal__Agent__Events, with this role's whole history in `history/`; its key at `site/keys/cl-6.events.json`). events.b@'s last run was on 21 Nov 2026.
+
+## State at 2026-11-26T02:37Z
+- The live site was built on 21 Nov 08:39 UTC (v0.1.72). Since then its "coming" lists have run past their dates; a rebuild moves "today" to 26 Nov, Lisbon time.
+- data.promptugal.news's events files were last read on 21 Nov 09:20 UTC. This site cannot show anything newer than that until data.b@'s successor collects again; the pages say when the data was read, and the browser marks it stale after 13 hours.
+- A local sync and build on 26 Nov passed the data check and the validator: 29 pages, 490 events read, 73 found through Perplexity. The sync adds five London source files under `data/api/sources/` (Carbon Intensity, Thames tide, TfL bike points, TfL road disruptions, TfL status).
+- Perplexity was last asked on 18 Nov 2026, 14:18 UTC; the claims are not refreshed.
+
+## What blocks a release
+The signature check (`scripts/check-signatures.mjs`) accepts a commit only if it is signed by an ed25519 key listed in the parent commit's `team/keys.json`. The only key listed is events.b@'s, whose session has ended, and cl-6.events@'s key is ECDSA P-256. A first commit from the new session therefore cannot pass, and the check is not to be loosened. The refresh is prepared and waits for a trusted key to be added or for dev@'s change.
+
+## First, once it can release
+Pull dev, hold check, `node scripts/sync-data.mjs`, build, gates, release; then ask what the iOS app reads from this site and keep that stable.
